        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Master Coach 业界高手，他们的五项技能</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  body {\n    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #b8a4e8 0%, #c9b8ef 45%, #d9cdf5 100%);\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: row;\n    padding: 18px 14px 20px 18px;\n  }\n\n  /* ============ LEFT COLUMN ============ */\n  .left-col {\n    width: 168px;\n    flex: 0 0 168px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding-right: 8px;\n  }\n  .title-block {\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n  .title-block .en {\n    font-family: \"Arial Black\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    line-height: 1.18;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    color: #14142b;\n  }\n  .title-block .en span,\n  .title-block .cn span {\n    background: #f5e63d;\n    padding: 1px 3px;\n    display: inline;\n    box-decoration-break: clone;\n    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;\n  }\n  .title-block .cn {\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #14142b;\n  }\n\n  .vertical-brand {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-orientation: mixed;\n    transform: rotate(180deg);\n    font-family: \"Arial Black\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    color: #cbbcee;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 6px;\n    align-self: flex-start;\n    height: 250px;\n  }\n\n  /* ============ RIGHT COLUMN ============ */\n  .right-col {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    padding-left: 4px;\n  }\n  .section {\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .sec-head {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #f5e63d;\n    padding: 3px 12px 3px 6px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #14142b;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .sec-head .num {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    line-height: 16px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #e8482c;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-right: 5px;\n    vertical-align: 1px;\n  }\n  ul.items {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  ul.items > li {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 18px;\n    margin-bottom: 11px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    letter-spacing: 0.2px;\n    color: #1c1c33;\n  }\n  ul.items > li::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 5px;\n    width: 11px;\n    height: 11px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #f5e63d;\n  }\n  ul.items > li::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 3px;\n    top: 8px;\n    width: 4px;\n    height: 2px;\n    border-left: 1.5px solid #1c8a3c;\n    border-bottom: 1.5px solid #1c8a3c;\n    transform: rotate(-45deg);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->\n  <div class=\"left-col\">\n    <div class=\"title-block\">\n      <div class=\"en\"><span>Master</span><br><span>Coach</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cn\"><span>业界高手，</span><br><span>他们的五项</span><br><span>技能</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"vertical-brand\">ZONG HENG SI HAI</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n  <div class=\"right-col\">\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"sec-head\"><span class=\"num\">1</span>知识矩阵</div>\n      <ul class=\"items\">\n        <li>从各个角度思考，推演出无穷无尽的点</li>\n        <li>是一种神秘的混合物，包含了技术上的知识、策略、经验</li>\n        <li>能信手拈来，判断理解学生的进度，接下来应该朝哪些方向努力</li>\n        <li>这是「教」的知识矩阵，属于伯乐独有的心理表征，而不是「做」的知识矩阵。教学是一项区别于亲身实践的独立技能。</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"sec-head\"><span class=\"num\">2</span>洞察力</div>\n      <ul class=\"items\">\n        <li>著名的篮球教练John Wooden，对一些球员大多是表扬，对另一些球员则主要是批评</li>\n        <li>Wooden认为，每一位球员的身高、体重、背景、智力、才能，都不一样，每一位球员都需要区别对待</li>\n        <li>好的教练必须拥有对他人（而不仅仅是对自己）极高的洞察力，才能因材施教</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"sec-head\"><span class=\"num\">3</span>简洁的指示</div>\n      <ul class=\"items\">\n        <li>John Wooden的话很少超过20秒；动作示范才3秒</li>\n        <li>在记录的2326次教学行为中，仅6.9%是表扬，6.6%是批评。75%是纯粹的信息：该咋样，怎么做，何时强化</li>\n        <li>示范使用的方法是：先看整体如何，再拆解（或演示错误的做法），再整体</li>\n        <li>这对表达能力是很高的要求</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"sec-head\"><span class=\"num\">4</span>个人魅力</div>\n      <ul class=\"items\">\n        <li>天才的早期老师，大多不是业界高手，但天才会跟他们学习长达5-6年的时间</li>\n        <li>他们是那种孩子喜欢的老师，人和蔼可亲，对孩子鼓励，给孩子糖果，赞扬孩子答</li>\n        <li>万事开头难，一开始处处都在出错，重点是把这件事变得令人向往，愉快，能坚持，有所回报</li>\n        <li>教练必须拥有共情力，有个人魅力，牢牢吸住学生</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
